{"id":"de_tresse","lemma":"détresse","pos":"noun","rank":3309,"glosses":["distress, despair, anguish"],"ipa":"/de.tʁɛs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Anonym%C3%A2t_%28Kvardek_du%29-d%C3%A9tresse.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Anonym%C3%A2t_%28Kvardek_du%29-d%C3%A9tresse.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"détresses"},"formAudio":{"détresses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-d%C3%A9tresses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ils ont compris ma détresse.","en":"They understood my plight.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to understand","l":"comprendre"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null]},{"text":"Je lance un signal de détresse.","en":"I'm declaring an emergency.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to throw","l":"lancer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"signal"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je sais que Tom est en détresse.","en":"I know Tom is troubled.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"that / what"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Nous n’avons pas peur de n’importe quelle détresse.","en":"We're not afraid of any difficulties.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to matter","l":"importer"},{"g":"which?"},null]},{"text":"Vous n'avez pas idée de la détresse dans laquelle elle était.","en":"You have no idea how distressed she was.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"idea"},null,null,null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"which, that, whom","l":"lequel"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]}]}